<title>USA: Catalytica files registration.</title>
<headline>Catalytica files registration.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalytica Inc filed a statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) for its previously announced intention to issue warrants to purchase common stock.</p>
<p>The maximum net proceeds from the sale of the common stock issuable upon exercise of the warrants are estimated at about $26.5 million, assuming all shares are purchased pursuant to the exercise of the warrants and after deducting estimated expenses of the issuance of the Warrants.</p>
<p>The Warrants will be issued at no cost to shareholders, entitling them to purchase one share of stock for each three shares of stock held at a purchase price of $4.00 per share.</p>
</text>
